{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfu1s8LjwEVUSqrVpfCb1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: build the normalisation now, and don't make the survey a precondition.**\n\n**Why**\n- You already have behavioural evidence, which is stronger than stated satisfaction. 18% of searches return nothing, the top zero-result terms are mostly formatting variants of part numbers, and about 340 calls a month are tagged \"can't find part online\".\n- The fix is cheap (about 3 days) and easy to reverse. A survey would take longer than the fix and wouldn't change the decision. Nobody will conclude that customers are happy when 18% of searches fail.\n\n**Before shipping (about half a day)**\n- Check what share of zero-result *search volume* the formatting-variant terms account for. Top-200 term counts can mislead, because a long tail may hide other causes such as parts you don't stock, synonyms or misspellings.\n- Record baselines: zero-result rate, search-to-add-to-basket rate, and monthly \"can't find part\" calls.\n- Spec the edge cases. Strip dashes, spaces and case, but rank exact matches first. Watch for ambiguous characters (O/0, I/1) and for part numbers where punctuation distinguishes two different items.\n\n**After shipping**\n- Compare against baseline after 2–4 weeks. Success looks like a clearly lower zero-result rate and fewer tagged calls. A rough bar is the zero-result rate falling by about a third or more, but set the target before you ship.\n- If a large zero-result share remains, investigate the remainder (stock gaps, synonyms) as the next step.\n\n**For the head of sales**\nA short survey or a few customer calls *after* the fix is worthwhile for the residual problems. Sales' own call tags are already a good measurement channel, so use them as the main outcome metric."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3447,"cache_read_input_tokens":5035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3447},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd4899a6-9deb-4420-a017-9c1d9755e221","uuid":"4ee726d2-8b5f-4188-b78b-be2e763c7113","timestamp":"2026-10-10T18:17:47.855Z","request_id":"req_011Cfu1s85cAYh6ps2GQtQFu"}
